  "sourceState": "Scheduling Wave A: the reservation coordinator ported verbatim minus the Razor/localization UI surface (14 pinned cases — the migration substrate-gap said 16, an over-count vs the verified inventory — plus 2 supplemental non-pinned idempotency invariants), the kernel-lease dependency carried as a LOCAL narrow compatibility port under the Harborline.Kernel.Lease namespace until a platform lease kernel exists, and the ticket-084 harvest landed executable: the Planning solver seed (namespace Harborline.Blocks.Scheduling.Planning) with the 12-fixture authored corpus byte-exact against the pinned blobs, 36 adopted fixture rows, and 3 re-authored invariants (cross-process TZ determinism, explanation-trace refs, static-manifest guard). T-491/occurrence-generation moves the due seam and the versioned chain ledger into Scheduling and adds the lone due date, per-basis generators and distinct validity classification. T-491/module-admission adds typed module admission, backend capability checks and published-pin planning through the shared foundation availability contract, capped below certified pending DES-0022 open ruling 3. T-491/schedule-refusals (interface revision 9) adds explicit validate-time recovery/regulator/upstream-plan refusals and the authoring-only host-resolved K9 facade through the shared checker (control PR 1358), with a shared literal refusal corpus. T-1197/bounded-expansion (interface revision 11) uses one 50000-unit due-query budget across rule input, supplied overrides, recurrence periods and matched dates, with a 3660-date requested-window maximum. List-returning producer methods retain the original single Ical.Net evaluator, their unbudgeted Calendar/Booking contract and separate 1000-result cap. Bound metadata is null only when input text exhausts work before classification. Extreme zoned UNTIL dates are handled without overflowing local DateTime. Control rulings 1371/1372/1378; T-1202 owns bounding calendar composers. Direct public-source budget creation and override preprocessing translate the same structured budget refusal as Query, including all eight diagnostic fields.",
